## What I Learned

### Quality Is Built Through Testing

Even well-designed features can reveal issues when tested from a user's perspective.

### Small Bugs Have Big Impact

Minor UI glitches or edge-case failures can significantly reduce user trust.

### Production Readiness Requires Verification

Testing functionality, performance, accessibility, and reliability together creates a much stronger product.

